        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/marvel-rivals-size.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>In a world afflicted with ever-increasing storage and RAM costs, it's nice to see a game make a serious effort to reduce its footprint on your SSD. Cue Marvel Rivals. On PS5 and Xbox, you will see an install-size reduction of roughly 15GB - down from 73GB - whilst the PC version reduces by a whopping 40GB. This means we're getting a reduction of roughly 20 percent on consoles, whereas on PC the file size will shrink by over 57 percent.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/marvel-rivals-file-size-reduction-pc-xbox-playstation\">Read more</a></p>",
